  "text": "```verilog\nmodule areset_deassert_sync #(\n    parameter CHAINS = 2,\n    parameter RST_POL = 1'b1\n)(\n    input  clk,\n    input  async_rst_i,\n    output sync_rst_o\n);\n\n    localparam DEASSERT_POL = ~RST_POL;\n\n    reg [CHAINS-1:0] sync_chain;\n\n    always @(posedge clk or posedge async_rst_i) begin\n        if (async_rst_i) begin\n            sync_chain <= {CHAINS{1'b1}};\n        end else begin\n            sync_chain <= {sync_chain[CHAINS-2:0], DEASSERT_POL};\n        end\n    end\n\n    assign sync_rst_o = RST_POL ? ~sync_chain[CHAINS-1] : sync_chain[CHAINS-1];\n\nendmodule\n```<|im_end|>",
